# Account and Data Deletion

Last Updated: September 2026

FilaTare does not maintain user accounts or store user data on developer-controlled servers.

Users can delete their data at any time by:

1. Opening FilaTare and removing stored inventory data.
2. Deleting any local backup files created by the app.
3. Removing application data in Android Settings.
4. Uninstalling the application.

If Google Drive backup has been enabled, users may also remove any backup files stored in their own Google Drive account.

To disconnect Google Sign-In access, visit:
https://myaccount.google.com/permissions

For questions regarding data removal, contact: wild.sulfur93@eagereverest.com
